<http://data.silknow.org/object/bbed334e-0aca-3f7d-9bbe-0099b9a88b82>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woman's sleeveless coat, China, tapestry weave (kesi), China, early 18th century"@en , "Imperial Robe (sleeveless), of tapestry-weave silk (kesi), woven in coloured silks and gold thread; some of the details have been executed with the brush. \nThe design consists of five-clawed dragons pursuing flaming jewels among clouds; in the intervals are bats and the eight Buddhist emblems (pa chi-hsiang) tied with fillets. The borders are mounted with a band of brocade woven with small dragon medallions and the eight precious symbols (ba bao)."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/dae31ea4-14d3-355d-97bc-d3b63eaa237e> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Imperial Robe (sleeveless), of tapestry-weave silk (kesi), woven in coloured silks and gold thread; some of the details have been executed with the brush. \nThe design consists of five-clawed dragons pursuing flaming jewels among clouds; in the intervals are bats and the eight Buddhist emblems (pa chi-hsiang) tied with fillets. The borders are mounted with a band of brocade woven with small dragon medallions and the eight precious symbols (ba bao)."@en , "Woman's sleeveless coat, China, tapestry weave (kesi), China, early 18th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/bbed334e-0aca-3f7d-9bbe-0099b9a88b82/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/bbed334e-0aca-3f7d-9bbe-0099b9a88b82/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/bbed334e-0aca-3f7d-9bbe-0099b9a88b82/dimension/3> ;
